{"scene_id": "s02093", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02093.fountain", "heading": "INT. STARLITE LANES - SHOE COUNTER - 3 A.M.", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "LEANDRA CHO", "names": ["LEANDRA CHO", "LEANDRA"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 26}, {"id": 1, "name": "DOBRYNIN", "names": ["DOBRYNIN", "MR. DOBRYNIN"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 27}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. STARLITE LANES - SHOE COUNTER - 3 A.M.", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "The bowling alley is empty and dim, only the pin machines still thumping in the back lanes.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Rows of rental shoes in cubbies.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A cash register with a taped-up drawer.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "On the wall, a faded poster of a dancing pin.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "LEANDRA CHO, 17, in a red vest too big for her, sits on a stool behind the counter, doing homework she is not doing.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from her, MR. DOBRYNIN, 60s, the night manager, in a cardigan, polishes a bowling shoe with a rag, slowly, as if there were nothing else in the world.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're early tonight.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm always early.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not by two hours.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Couldn't sleep.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mm.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "He holds the shoe to the light, finds a speck, rubs it.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "She turns a page of her textbook.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Neither looks at the other.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mr. Dobrynin, can I ask you something?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You can ask.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Did you always work here?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thirty-one years.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Before that?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Before that I was a bus driver.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why'd you quit?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I didn't like the people.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And you like these people?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "These people are going somewhere very slowly. A bus is going somewhere on a schedule. I prefer slowly.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's kind of sad.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it?", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They just roll a ball and it hits things.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And then they roll another one.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And it hits less.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And then they go home.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "She smiles.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "It is a small, private smile.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My dad used to bring me here.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Did he?", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sundays. He'd get me the cheese fries and the shoes in size one.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I remember.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You don't.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gray carpet jacket. Smoked a pipe outside.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He did.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gave me a dollar every time. Said it was for the shoes.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was always for the shoes.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He was a generous man.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He was a man who left.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Both things.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "She picks at the corner of her textbook.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "He sets down the shoe, takes another.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What do you say to someone who's mad at someone who's gone?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You don't say anything. You hand them a pair of shoes.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's not an answer.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's the only one I have.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Size what?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You tell me.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Seven.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lane twelve is open.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's three in the morning.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The pins don't know.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks at him.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "He looks at the shoe.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "After a moment she slides off the stool and walks to the cubbies, finds a seven, and holds it up.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "These?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Those are fine.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Will you come?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I have to polish.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mr. Dobrynin.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "One frame.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["a long breath"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "He sets down the rag.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "She is already pulling on the shoes.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You'll hate how bad I am.", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I've seen worse.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who?", "name": "LEANDRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your father.", "name": "MR. DOBRYNIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "She laughs, a real laugh this time, wet at the edges, and grabs the stool, steadying herself.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Mr. Dobrynin comes around the counter in his socks, shoes in one hand, and the two of them walk together down the dark carpet toward Lane Twelve.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}]}